\item[S2] Tom Bourne and Nik Ruškuc, On the Star-Height of Subword Counting Languages and Their Relationship to Rees Zero-Matrix Semigroups, arXiv:1603.06236v2 (2016), Section 1, definitions and the question of generalized height greater than one. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1603.06236v2}.
